    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just sadness. it's like... there's no point to any of it. i look at the clock and i realize i have 15 hours of nothingness ahead of me. i have nothing to care for, nothing to work for, nothing to be. the idea of just... stopping. of not having to face another one of these silent days. it almost feels like the only logical way to deal with this much emptiness.",
